                    M U S T   G O

            live from the REPO-TV floor, Coldwater
::endasset

::scene TITLE

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE emg_logo

3s

::scene OPEN

CAM 1 WIDE

NPC npc_emg_vance
NPC npc_emg_jolene
NPC npc_emg_pim

ACTION npc_emg_vance spreads his arms.

Vance Pellow:
Good morning, Coldwater. Everything you see today was in somebody's flat last week.

Vance Pellow:
They couldn't pay. You can.

EVENT LAUGHTER

LOWER_THIRD
EVERYTHING MUST GO
Lines are open. Bailiffs are standing by.
LOWER_THIRD_END

::scene LOT ONE

CAM 3 MEDIUM on Jolene

ACTION npc_emg_jolene holds up the toaster.

Jolene Marsh:
Lot one. A two-slice toaster. Barely burnt.

Vance Pellow:
Look at that chrome, Jolene.

Jolene Marsh:
There's a crumb tray, Vance. It comes out.

Vance Pellow:
They don't make them like that any more. They don't make them at all, actually. The factory's a car park.

EVENT LAUGHTER

CAM 2 MEDIUM on Pim

ACTION npc_emg_pim picks up the phone.

Pim:
Vance, I've got a caller on line three.

Vance Pellow:
Put her through, Pim.

Pim:
She says that's her toaster.

EVENT LAUGHTER

CAM 1 WIDE

ACTION npc_emg_vance leans in.

Vance Pellow:
Was. Was her toaster.

Pim:
She wants to buy it back.

ACTION npc_emg_vance slaps the counter.

Vance Pellow:
Then the price just went up. Sentimental value.

Jolene Marsh:
Forty credits.

Pim:
She's crying.

Vance Pellow:
Forty-five.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene LOT TWO

CAM 3 MEDIUM on Jolene

ACTION npc_emg_jolene holds up a framed photograph.

Jolene Marsh:
Lot two. A family photograph, frame included.

Vance Pellow:
Lovely frame. Real wood. You can take the family out.

Jolene Marsh:
Vance, that's my sister.

ACTION npc_emg_vance looks at the photograph.

Vance Pellow:
So it is. Small world.

EVENT LAUGHTER

Jolene Marsh:
She said she was moving.

Vance Pellow:
She did move. Twelve credits, Coldwater.

ACTION npc_emg_pim picks up the phone.

Pim:
Line one wants the toaster and the sister.

Vance Pellow:
The sister isn't for sale. Yet.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene LAST LOT

CAM 2 MEDIUM on Pim

ACTION npc_emg_pim picks up the phone.

Pim:
Vance, there's a man on line six. He's from the bank.

Vance Pellow:
Tell him we're live.

Pim:
He says he knows. He says he's in reception.

ACTION npc_emg_jolene points at the counter.

Jolene Marsh:
He wants the counter, Vance.

ACTION npc_emg_pim looks at the phones.

Pim:
And the phones.

CAM 1 WIDE

ACTION npc_emg_vance looks into the camera.

Vance Pellow:
You heard him, Coldwater. Everything must go.

EVENT APPLAUSE

CREDITS 10
EVERYTHING MUST GO

All goods sold as seen.
No refunds. No returns. No questions.
REPO-TV, Coldwater
END_CREDITS

EVENT FADE_OUT

END
